Added the grid and column settings: the column count, layout presets, background, headline, gap, stacking and delete for the grid; the position, width and actions of a column. They show in the host's sidebar, or in a popover from the column handle. A new grid opens its settings, a press on a gap selects the grid, and Esc goes up from a column to the grid and the page. In the editor, the column with the caret or whose settings show stands out, and Tab from a column handle goes into its settings. @Humanaice
